005A 1307    89         JEQ  SERV              Y, SERVICE IT
005C 8EBA    90  NXTDEV C    *R10+,*R10+       SKIP STORAGE AREA
005E 0603    91         DEC  R3                COUNT DEVICE
0060 16F5    92         JNE  NXTENT            LOOP TILL ALL DEVICES DONE
