             94  * NON-STANDARD DEVICE INTERRUPT
             95  *
0062 C249    96         MOV  R9,R9             TRAP SET?
0064 1301    97         JEQ  EXIT4             N, IGNORE IT
0066 0419    98         BLWP *R9               Y, GOTO ROUTINE
0068 0380    99  EXIT4  RTWP                   EXIT
            100  *
            101  * SERVICE 9902 INTERRUPT
            102  *
